{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573410/extras/873ea56d141b6ecd2a6d15745b6354a3.poster.avif?t=1760617232\" width=330 height=186 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573410/extras/873ea56d141b6ecd2a6d15745b6354a3.webm?t=1760617232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573410/extras/873ea56d141b6ecd2a6d15745b6354a3.mp4?t=1760617232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Scientific evidence, eyewitness testimony, and objective facts\u2014when these align, the truth emerges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tAs my grandfather Holmes used to say:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whatever remains, however improbable, must be the truth.&quot;</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd39 Synopsis</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tYou awaken in a strange office\u2014your memories are gone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tBeside you stands a woman who claims to be a consulting private detective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tShe seems to know you, though you have no idea who she is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tPiece together the truth behind your lost memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd39 Game Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tGenre: Mystery / Detective / Light Puzzle / Yuri themes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tPlaytime: Approx. 30\u201340 minutes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tDifficulty: Casual, accessible even to mystery newcomers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd39 Main Heroine</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573410/extras/99423db91c5d3cfac73d98cec027e92f.poster.avif?t=1760617232\" width=423 height=616 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573410/extras/99423db91c5d3cfac73d98cec027e92f.webm?t=1760617232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Name: Yaka Sharoku (English: Sherok Holmes)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tGender: Female</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tAge: 27</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tHeight: 158 cm</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tBlood Type: AB</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tBirthday: January 6</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tProfession: Consulting Private Detective</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tThe only police-affiliated consulting detective in Japan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tBorn in London, Sharok graduated top of her class in law at the University of Cambridge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tShe specializes in psychology, anthropology, and forensic science, and has solved numerous difficult cases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tOfficial records suggest she may be descended from the brother of the legendary Holmes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tOutwardly, she might seem easygoing or even flirtatious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tBut in truth, she is a steadfast guardian of justice\u2014just like her famous ancestors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Also known as:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fb\u300aSHEROK \u7684\u8a18\u61b6\u6a94\u6848\u300b (Traditional Chinese / \u7e41\u9ad4\u4e2d\u6587)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fb\u300aSHEROK\u7684\u8bb0\u5fc6\u6863\u6848\u300b (Simplified Chinese / \u7b80\u4f53\u4e2d\u6587)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30